    path: "M12 2.16c3.2 0 3.58.01 4.85.07 1.17.05 1.8.25 2.23.41.56.22.96.48 1.38.9.42.42.68.82.9 1.38.16.42.36 1.06.41 2.23.06 1.27.07 1.65.07 4.85s-.01 3.58-.07 4.85c-.05 1.17-.25 1.8-.41 2.23-.22.56-.48.96-.9 1.38-.42.42-.82.68-1.38.9-.42.16-1.06.36-2.23.41-1.27.06-1.65.07-4.85.07s-3.58-.01-4.85-.07c-1.17-.05-1.8-.25-2.23-.41a3.72 3.72 0 0 1-1.38-.9 3.72 3.72 0 0 1-.9-1.38c-.16-.42-.36-1.06-.41-2.23-.06-1.27-.07-1.65-.07-4.85s.01-3.58.07-4.85c.05-1.17.25-1.8.41-2.23.22-.56.48-.96.9-1.38.42-.42.82-.68 1.38-.9.42-.16 1.06-.36 2.23-.41C8.42 2.17 8.8 2.16 12 2.16ZM12 0C8.74 0 8.33.01 7.05.07 5.78.13 4.9.33 4.14.63A5.88 5.88 0 0 0 2 2C1.36 2.64.97 3.3.63 4.14.33 4.9.13 5.78.07 7.05.01 8.33 0 8.74 0 12s.01 3.67.07 4.95c.06 1.27.26 2.15.56 2.91.34.84.73 1.5 1.37 2.14.64.64 1.3 1.03 2.14 1.37.76.3 1.64.5 2.91.56C8.33 23.99 8.74 24 12 24s3.67-.01 4.95-.07c1.27-.06 2.15-.26 2.91-.56a5.88 5.88 0 0 0 2.14-1.37c.64-.64 1.03-1.3 1.37-2.14.3-.76.5-1.64.56-2.91.06-1.28.07-1.69.07-4.95s-.01-3.67-.07-4.95c-.06-1.27-.26-2.15-.56-2.91A5.88 5.88 0 0 0 22 2 5.88 5.88 0 0 0 19.86.63c-.76-.3-1.64-.5-2.91-.56C15.67.01 15.26 0 12 0Zm0 5.84A6.16 6.16 0 1 0 12 18.16 6.16 6.16 0 0 0 12 5.84Zm0 10.15a4 4 0 1 1 0-7.98 4 4 0 0 1 0 7.98ZM19.85 5.6a1.44 1.44 0 1 1-2.88 0 1.44 1.44 0 0 1 2.88 0Z",
